# Code owners: who must approve a pull request that touches each area.
#
# GitHub reads this file top to bottom and the LAST matching line wins. With branch
# protection on main ("Require a pull request" + "Require review from Code Owners"),
# the merge button stays locked until an owner of every touched area approves.
#
# The repository belongs to a personal account, where GitHub teams do not exist, so
# every area is owned by @SebastianoDruda. The team that would own it in an
# organisation is named on each line; moving the repository to an organisation
# means replacing the owner with that team, e.g. @dimora/apartment-team.
# See docs/devops.md for the team model and the pipelines each team runs.

